WEBVTT

00:03:59.807 --> 00:04:04.498
KFL: The field of AI
actually began in the 50s.

00:04:04.522 --> 00:04:08.594
And the field really
hasn't made much progress

00:04:08.618 --> 00:04:10.880
until deep learning came about.

00:04:10.904 --> 00:04:15.817
And deep learning is learning
purely on correlation,

00:04:15.841 --> 00:04:17.967
on huge amount of data,

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:22.705
and then draws the features
and conclusions

00:04:22.729 --> 00:04:24.196
pretty much by itself.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:29.871
So if you think about
recognizing pictures of cats,

00:04:29.895 --> 00:04:33.879
it just sees millions
and even billions of pictures,